		<div class="container">
			<h1>View Books</h1>
			<h2>Step 1 - Launch the app</h2>
			<p>Start the Library App. The main window will open with "My Library" at the top.</p>

			<h2>Step 2 - Wait for the books to load</h2>
			<p>It may take a moment for the cards to appear as the books load in the background. A book with no cover image in OpenLibrary shows as a gray placeholder image instaed.</p>
			<img src="/images/loading.png" style="width: 100%; max-width: 800px;" alt="This is the main window of Library App that is still loading"/>

			<h2>Step 3 - Scroll through the results</h2>
			<p>Use the scroll bar to see all the cards.</p>
			<img src="/images/mainwindow.png" style="width: 100%; max-width: 800px;" alt="This is the main window of Library App that is still loading"/>


			
